1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,236
Doctors grew an EAR

2
00:00:01,276 --> 00:00:03,116
inside this woman’s FOREARM.

3
00:00:03,156 --> 00:00:04,601
She lost her ear in a crash,

4
00:00:04,641 --> 00:00:06,321
so surgeons carved a replacement

5
00:00:06,361 --> 00:00:07,936
from her own rib cartilage.

6
00:00:07,976 --> 00:00:09,426
They tucked it beneath her arm skin,

7
00:00:09,466 --> 00:00:11,526
where new blood vessels formed around it.

8
00:00:11,566 --> 00:00:12,121
Months later,

9
00:00:12,161 --> 00:00:14,136
they moved the living ear to her head,

10
00:00:14,176 --> 00:00:16,376
reconnecting its blood supply and nerves.

11
00:00:16,416 --> 00:00:17,536
And for MONTHS…

12
00:00:17,576 --> 00:00:19,656
her new ear was right HERE.

